'''Primal Slayer''' is the upgraded form of [[Slayer]] using the [[Jade]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Jade]], they gain 10 [[Poison|poison damage]] and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply [[Immobilized]].

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

An upgraded Slayer will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Primal Slayer.

